name: Erratic King Spike — many Kings
author: corpus
description: >-
  Erratic Deck starting deck with at least 13 Kings, a 25% face-card rank spike for
  Baron, Mime, Triboulet, Steel/Red Seal held-in-hand lines, and naneinf attempts.
  RAG aliases: erratic kings, many Kings, Baron Mime, steel kings, held in hand.
deck: Erratic
stake: White
must:
  - erraticRank: King
    min: 13
should:
  - joker: Baron
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 60
  - joker: Mime
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 50
  - joker: Triboulet
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 45
  - standardCard:
      rank: K
      enhancement: Steel
      seal: Red
    label: "Red Seal Steel King target for held-in-hand scaling"
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 40
